From: PromethenDev <PromethenDev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 11:13:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 18/97] diagnostics: census CPU/GPU attribution fields
 (per-thread CPU, swap wait, GPU busy)

Adds [rate-census-cpu] per-second lines (top-5 thread CPU%, VdSwap thread
CPU%) and swap_wait/gpu_busy/gpu_wait fields. Off unless WWE13_RATE_CENSUS=1.
Note: gpu_busy_ms reads ~1000 even when idle-waiting; not a reliable signal.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
